sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Admin
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant EPCtrl as ExternalProvider<br/>Controller
    participant EMCtrl as ExternalModel<br/>Controller
    participant Secret as Credential Secret<br/>(same namespace)
    participant Istio as Istio Service Mesh
    participant GW as maas-default-gateway<br/>openshift-ingress
    participant Provider as External AI Provider<br/>443/HTTPS

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over User,Provider: ExternalProvider Reconciliation Flow
        User->>K8s: Create/Update ExternalProvider CR<br/>inference.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1
        K8s->>EPCtrl: Watch event (reconcile trigger)
        EPCtrl->>K8s: Get referenced credential Secret
        K8s-->>EPCtrl: Secret data (apikey/sigv4/oauth2)
        EPCtrl->>EPCtrl: Validate Secret exists
        EPCtrl->>K8s: Create/Update ExternalName Service<br/>(points to provider endpoint)
        EPCtrl->>K8s: Create/Update Istio ServiceEntry<br/>(MESH_EXTERNAL, DNS, HTTPS/443)
        EPCtrl->>K8s: Create/Update Istio DestinationRule<br/>(SIMPLE TLS origination)
        EPCtrl->>K8s: Update ExternalProvider status → Ready
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over User,Provider: ExternalModel Reconciliation Flow
        User->>K8s: Create/Update ExternalModel CR<br/>inference.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1
        K8s->>EMCtrl: Watch event (reconcile trigger)
        EMCtrl->>K8s: Get referenced ExternalProvider(s)
        K8s-->>EMCtrl: ExternalProvider(s) status
        EMCtrl->>EMCtrl: Verify provider(s) Ready
        EMCtrl->>K8s: Create/Update Gateway API HTTPRoute<br/>(model→provider routing, port 443, 300s timeout)
        K8s-->>GW: HTTPRoute programmed on gateway
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over User,Provider: Inference Request Flow (runtime)
        User->>GW: POST /v1/models/{model}:predict<br/>Auth per provider config
        GW->>Istio: Route via HTTPRoute match
        Istio->>Provider: Forward request<br/>TLS origination (SIMPLE)<br/>443/HTTPS
        Provider-->>Istio: AI response
        Istio-->>GW: Response
        GW-->>User: Inference result
    end
